🌱 Plant Scheduler Project

The Plant Scheduler is a web-based application designed to manage and organize plantation tasks efficiently.  
It allows users to schedule, track, and analyze plant-related activities with a simple interface.
📂 Project Structure
PlantSchedulerProject/
├── index.html # Homepage / UI
├── schedule.html # Plant scheduling page
├── login.html # Login page
├── styles/ # CSS files
├── scripts/ # JavaScript files
├── database/ # SQL files for MySQL
└── README.md # Project documentation
🚀 Features
- Add, update, and delete plant schedules  
- User authentication (login system)  
- Dashboard for managing tasks  
- Database connectivity with MySQL  
- Simple and responsive web interface
🔧 Technologies Used
- **Java** (Backend)  
- **JDBC (MySQL Connector)** for database connectivity  
- **MySQL** (Database)  
- **HTML, CSS, JavaScript** (Frontend)  
- **OOP Concepts**
